{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2024-06", "window": 2, "start_date": 1717804800, "end_date": 1718495999, "month_true_total": 2147, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 19:06:28 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "167454148", "author": {"steamid": "76561198105543218", "personaname": "Rinnika", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198105543218/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 15254, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1498, "last_played": 1763088622, "avatar": "1953cebbb8903d9b406fedcc33cb0757664d32c4"}, "language": "english", "review": "For those with Destiny 2 Bungie trauma, this game will make you feel better :)", "timestamp_created": 1718494990, "timestamp_updated": 1718494990, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "167451898", "author": {"steamid": "76561198281493598", "personaname": "SappyHappy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198281493598/", "num_games_owned": 325, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 173347, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 3270, "playtime_at_review": 118943, "last_played": 1789377557, "avatar": "885c4029fff92a6978617e0b730bcf245df812bb"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a great game for beginners, and if you like grindy games. I personally loved the game until it became inevitable that you have to keep doing the same repetitive missions over and over and over again. I can't tell you how infuriating it is to have a game with amazing movement, great character design with the frames, and the end game being a plat farming simulator and fashionframing. I would only recommend this game for maybe the first 100 ish hours, since it's f2p and it offers a lot, but once you finish the main quests, and start to get into steel path and min maxing, it's super unfun. No challenging gameplay, repetitive missions with zero reward incentive for time investment. Wasted potential ngl", "timestamp_created": 1718492034, "timestamp_updated": 1718492034, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.516171932220458984", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "167450910", "author": {"steamid": "76561198262209278", "personaname": "ScottAN", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198262209278/", "num_games_owned": 70, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 38399, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 49, "playtime_at_review": 2023, "last_played": 1789184013, "avatar": "84dc58ca1a2f3de775438c40336986687a1af72c"}, "language": "english", "review": "33 hours on PC... but like 500 on my Switch Lite. I love the passion the devs have for the project, the creativity and insanity that is Warframe. Perfect for my ADHD and my sci-fi  loving' brain.", "timestamp_created": 1718490717, "timestamp_updated": 1718490717, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "167450138", "author": {"steamid": "76561198231290424", "personaname": "Kiari", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198231290424/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 22315, "playtime_last_two_weeks"